# The VM's optimized code (src/jq/lang/execute/region.rs): straight-line regions,
# frameless calls of closures whose body is a region, natives evaluating such
# closures (select, map, repeat), and the in-place RET and RANGE. Everything must
# match jq exactly: values, errors and their order, side effects (debug, stderr,
# input), labels, path expressions, value identity (path($x)) and array storage
# (writing past the end of a view). Generated from the edge cases in
# src/jq/lang/execute/opt_tests.rs (write_vm_opt_corpus).
#
# Format: jq's .test format without expected output lines: a program line, one
# input line, and a blank line between cases.

